  "description": "QueryDB is a flexible database query framework designed to simplify querying and executing transactions across multiple database systems.\n\nSupported Databases:\n- MSSQL\n- MySQL\n- Oracle\n- PostgreSQL\n\nKey Features:\n- Efficient data retrieval using query and command execution.\n- Execute scalar queries for single-value results.\n- Execute non-query commands.\n- Perform multi-command transactions while maintaining atomicity.\n- Support for both Synchronous and Asynchronous operations.",
